/* Release history shown from General */
"当前信号准确性与界面收敛" = "Current signal accuracy and interface refinement";
"VRR 私有读取接口不可用时保留未知状态，不再错误显示为已开启。" = "When the private VRR read interface is unavailable, preserve the unknown state instead of incorrectly showing VRR as on.";
"HDR 状态来源全部缺失时显示未知，不再将没有证据折叠成 SDR。" = "When all HDR state sources are unavailable, show Unknown rather than treating missing evidence as SDR.";
"DSC 带宽判断区分 RGB／YCbCr 4:4:4 与 YCbCr 4:2:2；保留已经验证可用的间接协商控制路径。" = "DSC bandwidth assessment distinguishes RGB/YCbCr 4:4:4 from YCbCr 4:2:2; the verified indirect negotiation path remains available.";
"HDMI 接口不再显示意义有限的“物理接口”；无法直接确认 TMDS／FRL 时明确标注传输模式未确认。" = "HDMI no longer shows an uninformative physical-interface label; when TMDS/FRL cannot be directly confirmed, the transport mode is marked unconfirmed.";
"概览状态卡可跳转并定位到对应设置，目标设置会短暂高亮。" = "Overview status cards navigate to the corresponding setting and briefly highlight it.";
"连接与信号页增加内部路径、当前模式、像素链路与 DSC 判断依据。" = "Connection and Signal now shows the internal path, current mode, pixel link, and DSC assessment evidence.";
"AirPlay 兼容设备不再附加可能错误的 Apple TV 型号；EDID 原文可完整展开并一键复制。" = "AirPlay-compatible devices no longer receive potentially incorrect Apple TV model labels; raw EDID can be expanded and copied.";
"显示与输出页统一信息层级和控件行高，增加只锁定页面操作的当前配置保护。" = "Display & Output uses consistent information hierarchy and row heights, with configuration protection limited to page actions.";
"概览与快捷面板统一使用固定的 Right Display Logo。" = "Overview and Quick Control use a consistent Right Display logo.";
"CTA 视频、音频、扫描、量化、色度、HDR 与厂商数据块提供更直接的能力解读。" = "CTA video, audio, scan, quantization, colorimetry, HDR, and vendor blocks have clearer capability explanations.";
"当前输出时序仍来自模式枚举推定，并非接收端仪器实测；完整 EDID 语义解析仍留待 R4。" = "Current output timing is still inferred from mode enumeration, not measured at the receiver; full EDID semantic parsing remains deferred to R4.";
"显示事务目标与数据关联收紧" = "Tighter display transaction targeting and data association";
"显示事务、延迟回调、验证、失败和恢复固定使用发起操作时的显示器 ID，不再跟随界面选择。" = "Display transactions, delayed callbacks, verification, failure, and recovery remain bound to the display ID captured at the start.";
"目标显示器消失时安全失败，不把操作、偏好、能力或历史记录转移到另一块显示器。" = "If the target display disappears, fail safely without transferring actions, preferences, capabilities, or history to another display.";
"ProductID、EDID transport、generic EDID 与 framebuffer 数据只在唯一匹配时采用。" = "ProductID, EDID transport, generic EDID, and framebuffer data are used only when uniquely matched.";
"同型号且序列号为零时仍可能发生持久偏好冲突；完整身份迁移明确延后。" = "Persistent preference collisions remain possible for identical models with zero serial numbers; full identity migration is deferred.";
"移除不安全的 framebuffer 回退" = "Remove unsafe framebuffer fallback";
"EDID 与显示管线匹配失败时返回不可用，不再拿第一个 framebuffer 节点代替目标显示器。" = "If EDID cannot be matched to the display pipeline, report unavailable instead of substituting the first framebuffer node.";
"界面版本号改为读取安装包中的实际版本，避免升级后继续显示旧版本。" = "The interface reads the installed bundle version so an old version is not shown after upgrading.";
"链路验证失败与恢复表达修正" = "Link verification failure and recovery wording";
"链路写入后验证或复读失败时保留原设置回退信息，不再无条件清除 fallback。" = "If verification or readback fails after a link write, preserve the original-setting fallback instead of clearing it unconditionally.";
"没有可靠恢复复读时明确显示结果未确认，不再无依据声称已经恢复原设置。" = "When recovery lacks reliable readback, mark the result unconfirmed instead of claiming the original setting was restored.";
"本版本没有新增自动恢复，也没有断言私有恢复参数的跨系统语义。" = "This version adds no automatic recovery and makes no cross-system claim about private recovery parameters.";
